      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "Use this dashboard for audit evidence health and security tripwires.\n\n1. Audit event rate shows whether security-relevant events are being recorded.\n2. Audit write failures are critical because Storage.AuditLog is best-effort and must not fail silently.\n3. Refresh reuse and channel mismatch bursts are account takeover or client-policy signals.\n4. Cleanup panels show whether deletion, expiry, and audit PII lifecycle jobs are still running.\n5. Token introspection is intentionally metric evidence, not row-level audit log evidence.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "12.3.0",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
